## Examples of markdown's "stupid" list parsing

```
$ markdown.pl

  * item1

    * item2

  text
^D
<ul>
<li><p>item1</p>

<ul>
<li>item2</li>
</ul>

<p><p>text</p></li>
</ul></p>
```


```
$ marked
  * item1

    * item2

  text
^D
<ul>
<li><p>item1</p>
<ul>
<li>item2</li>
</ul>
<p>text</p>
</li>
</ul>
```

Which looks correct to you?

- - -

```
$ markdown.pl
* hello
  > world
^D
<p><ul>
<li>hello</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>world</li>
</ul></p>
</blockquote>
```

```
$ marked
* hello
  > world
^D
<ul>
<li>hello<blockquote>
<p>world</p>
</blockquote>
</li>
</ul>
```

Again, which looks correct to you?

